# Project Memory

## Objective

Long-lived knowledge belongs in the repo (`/docs`, `AGENTS.md`, rules)  -  not only in conversation history.

## Requirements

- Read `AGENTS.md` and project rules at session start when present.
- Update `/docs` when decisions should survive the session.
- Respect `REWRITE_PLAN.md`, `plan.md`, or equivalent project planning files  -  edit only when user asks.

## Cross-links

`knowledge-preservation.mdc`, `documentation-first.mdc`.

## Golden Rule

The repo is the source of truth; chat is ephemeral.